<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2168] Fix typo on Elasticsearch interpreter help</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2168</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Current:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Elasticsearch interpreter:
General format: &amp;lt;command&amp;gt; /&amp;lt;indices&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;types&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;id&amp;gt; &amp;lt;option&amp;gt; &amp;lt;JSON&amp;gt;
...
  - index /ndex/type/id &amp;lt;json-formatted document&amp;gt;
    . the id can be omitted, elasticsearch will generate one
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Should be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Elasticsearch interpreter:
General format: &amp;lt;command&amp;gt; /&amp;lt;indices&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;types&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;id&amp;gt; &amp;lt;option&amp;gt; &amp;lt;JSON&amp;gt;
...
  - index /index/type/id &amp;lt;json-formatted document&amp;gt;
    . the id can be omitted, elasticsearch will generate one
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
